Sure:
I want to number of arguments (i.e., vars1topaste and vars2topaste) for each function to be flexible. I just chose the paste function as an example. I would like to do the same also with other function. I hope it is more clear now

big_fun = function(vars1topaste,vars2topaste) {
within.var1 = function (vars1topaste) {condition1 = paste(vars1topaste,sep="_")
data$condition = factor(condition1)
return (head(data$condition1))
}

within.var2 = function (vars2topaste) {condition2 = paste(vars2topaste,sep="_")
data$condition = factor(condition1)
return (head(data$condition1))
}
}

Thanks!
Ayala

